i-language: KHM;">ព្រះរាជាណាចក្រកម្ពុជា</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br></span><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">ជាតិ សាសនា ព្រះមហាក្សត្រ</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br></span><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">គណៈកម្មាធិការប្រឡងថ្នាក់ជាតិ</span><span style="font-size: 16.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br></span><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">គ្រឹះស្ថាន៖</span><strong><span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">សាកលវិទ្យាល័យវិទ្យាសាស្រ្តសុខាភិបាល</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><span style="font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br></span><u><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">ពាក្យសុំចុះឈ្មោះប្រឡង</span></u></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">ខ្ញុំបាទ-នាងខ្ញុំឈ្មោះ </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">{{ data.first_name_kh }} {{ data.last_name_kh }} <span lang="KHM">អក្សរឡាតាំង </span>{{ data.first_name_en }} {{ data.last_name_en }}</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">ភេទ </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">{{ data.gender }} <span lang="KHM">កើតថ្ងៃទី </span>{{ data.date_of_birth }} <span lang="KHM">បេក្ខជនរៀននៅវិទ្យាល័យ </span>{{ data.high_school_candidate }} <span lang="KHM">ក្នុងខេត្ត </span>{{ data.province }} <span lang="KHM">បានប្រឡងជាប់សញ្ញាបត្រមធ្យមសិក្សាទុតិយភូមិនៅមណ្ឌលប្រឡង </span>{{ data.high_school_exam_center }} <span lang="KHM">ក្នុងខេត្ត </span>{{ data.province }}</span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><u><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">សូមគោរពជូន</span></u><u><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br></span></u><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">ឯកឧត្តមប្រធានគណះកម្មាធិការប្រឡងថ្នាក់ជាតិ</span><span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br><span lang="KHM">សម្រាប់ការបណ្តុះបណ្តាលក្នុងវិស័យសុខាភិបាល</span></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">​</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> <span lang="KHM">ខ្ញុំបាទ-នាងខ្ញុំ សូមគោរពជម្រាបជូន ឯកឧត្តមមេត្តាជ្រាបថា ខ្ញុំបាទ-នាងខ្ញុំ ស្នើសុំការអនុញ្ញាតចូលរួមប្រឡងថ្នាក់ជាតិជ្រើសរើសចូលរៀនឆ្នាំ </span>{{ data.application_year }} <span lang="KHM">ផ្នែក </span>{{ data.major }}<br><span lang="KHM">អាទិភាពទី១នៅគ្រឹះស្ថាន</span></span><strong><span lang="KHM" style="font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">៖ </span></strong><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">សាកលវិទ្យាល័យវិទ្យាសាស្រ្តសុខាភិបាល</span><span style="font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"><br></span><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">អាទិភាពទី២នៅគ្រឹះស្ថាន៖ </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">{{ data.institution }}<br><span lang="KHM">សម្រាប់ឆ្នាំ</span>{{ data.application_year }} <span lang="KHM">សិក្សាសម័យប្រឡង </span>{{ data.exam_session }} <span lang="KHM">និងសូមឯកឧត្តមមេត្តាពិនិត្យលទ្ធភាពឱ្យ</span><br><span lang="KHM">ខ្ញុំបាទ-នាងខ្ញុំ បានចុះឈ្មោះក្នុងបញ្ជីបេក្ខជនប្រឡងថ្នាក់ជាតិជ្រើសរើសចូលរៀន ថ្នាក់ឆ្នាំសិក្សាមូលដ្ឋាន ឬ ថ្នាក់ឆ្នាំទី ១ ដោយក្តីអនុគ្រោះ។</span><br>​</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 