 New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;"> </span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Battambang',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">​ <span lang="KHM">ខ្ញុំបាទ-នាងខ្ញុំ បានអាននូវបទបញ្ជាផ្ទៃក្នុងស្តីពីការប្រឡងថ្នាក់ជាតិជ្រើសរើសចូលរៀនក្នុងវិស័យសុខាភិបាល និង សន្យាគោរពតាមដោយគ្មានការតវ៉ា ក្នុងករណីដែល ខ្ញុំបាទ-នាងខ្ញុំ បានប្រព្រឹត្តខុសពីបទបញ្ជាផ្ទៃក្នុង។</span></span></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;" align="center"><u><span lang="KHM" style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-bidi-language: KHM;">សូមជូនភ្ជាប់មកជាមួយនូវ</span></u></p>\n<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: