n: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">ទីកន្លែងកំណើត (រាជធានី/ខេត្ត):&nbsp; &nbsp;{{ data.birth_province_city }}</span></p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">កំរិតសញ្ញាបត្របច្ចុប្បន្ន: {{ data.current_degree }}&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">មុខរបរ/អង្គភាព: {{ data.current_occupation }}</span></p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 14px; font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">លេខទូរស័ព្ទ : {{ data.phone_number }} អ៊ីម៉ែល {{ data.email }}</span></p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style="text-align: justify;">&nbsp;</p>\n<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 38.2628%; height: 79.1291px; border-width: 1px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;" border="1"><colgroup><col style="width: 100%;"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style="height: 79.1291px;">\n<td><span style="font-size: 14px;"><span style="font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">លេខបញ្ជី</span>.............................................</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 16.5071%; height: 143.2px; border-width: 1px; margin-right: 0px; margin-left: auto;" border="1"><colgroup><col style="width: 100%;"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style="height: 143.2px;">\n<td style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">បិទរូបថតថ្មី</span><br><span style="font-family: Battambang, sans-serif;">៤ &times; ៦</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style="text-align: center;">&nbsp;<span style="font-family: 'Khmer OS Muol Light', Moul, cursive; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 14px;">បង្កាន់ដៃទទួលពាក្យ</span>​</span></p>\n<p dir="l